(# Web: Cookie Smith) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Summary) Tj
T*
(Forge the auth cookie by abusing a SHA-1 length extension weakness in a naive "secret-prefix") Tj
T*
(signature.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Challenge) Tj
T*
(- Endpoint: GET /profile?user=guest sets auth=<base64\(...\)>) Tj
T*
